translate chinese street_71cd68f4:

    # mc "How’s Norman?"
    mc "诺曼怎么样？"

#game/script.rpy:1550
translate chinese street_b59662fa:

    # mc "He behaving himself?"
    mc "他乖吗？"

#game/script.rpy:1552
translate chinese street_d338edbe:

    # A "No, not at all. He’s wonderful — maybe too wonderful, if you ask me..."
    A "不，一点都不。他很好——要我说，可能好过头了……"

#game/script.rpy:1554
translate chinese street_c619e108:

    # A "But because of his business trips lately, he hasn’t been able to spend much time with us."
    A "但最近因为出差，他没什么时间陪我们。"

#game/script.rpy:1556
translate chinese street_9f6c040d:

    # A "He is always buried in his work, and I’m not sure what it is exactly, but... "
    A "他总是埋头工作，我不太确定具体是什么，但……"

#game/script.rpy:1557
translate chinese street_a56c3955:

    # A "We’ve really started to miss him a lot."
    A "我们真的开始很想他。"

#game/script.rpy:1558
translate chinese street_1756220f:

    # A "Every time I ask, he says it's classified."
    A "每次我问，他都说那是机密。"

#game/script.rpy:1559
translate chinese street_91d9b536:

    # A "Which would sound cooler if it didn't keep stealing him from us."
    A "如果这没把他从我们身边抢走，听起来会更酷。"

#game/script.rpy:1561
translate chinese street_2b35b6fe_4:

    # mc "..."
    mc "……"

#game/script.rpy:1562
translate chinese street_41e3070d:

    # mc "(Classified...)"
    mc "（机密……）"

#game/script.rpy:1563
translate chinese street_47b6c65f:

    # mc "(Of course.)"
    mc "（当然。）"

#game/script.rpy:1565
translate chinese street_e2dbf220:

    # N "Hey, it’s not that bad, babe."
    N "嘿，没那么糟，宝贝。"

#game/script.rpy:1566
translate chinese street_9f22c481:

    # N "I’m busting my ass out there for you and Mina."
    N "我在外面为我和米娜拼命。"

#game/script.rpy:1568
translate chinese street_470d3d9e:

    # N "You know that, right? I’m doing it for you. I love you both more than anything."
    N "你知道的，对吧？我是为了你们。我爱你们胜过一切。"

#game/script.rpy:1572
translate chinese street_4bfa1d50:

    # A "If you say so, I guess..."
    A "既然你这么说……"

#game/script.rpy:1574
translate chinese street_55d35a93:

    # A "But still, you spend way too much time at work."
    A "但你还是花太多时间在工作上了。"

#game/script.rpy:1575
translate chinese street_fa43daf6:

    # A "It’s like you’re practically living there. {w}You could be gone for weeks on end...."
    A "你简直就像住在那里。{w}你可能一连消失好几周……"

#game/script.rpy:1577
translate chinese street_fc870606:

    # M "And again...."
    M "又来了……"

#game/script.rpy:1579
translate chinese street_cd46aae1:

    # mc "This happen a lot?"
    mc "经常这样吗？"

#game/script.rpy:1583
translate chinese street_b6a3f722:

    # M "No! Not that often, to be honest. {w}Just every now and then."
    M "不！说实话没那么频繁。{w}只是偶尔。"

#game/script.rpy:1585
translate chinese street_9632e6ad:

    # M "Everything used to be fine between them, but lately, it seems to have gotten a lot worse."
    M "以前他们之间一切都好，但最近好像糟糕多了。"

#game/script.rpy:1587
translate chinese street_0b9fa0ac:

    # N "Alright… yeah. I’m sorry."
    N "好吧……嗯。对不起。"

#game/script.rpy:1588
translate chinese street_1d73e198:

    # N "I’ll try, okay? I’ll be around more."
    N "我会努力的，好吗？我会多陪陪你们。"

#game/script.rpy:1590
translate chinese street_2ad6d992:

    # mc "Didn’t expect that."
    mc "没想到。"

#game/script.rpy:1592
translate chinese street_50fef891:

    # N "There we go again… I said I’m sorry, alright?"
    N "又来了……我说了对不起，行吗？"

#game/script.rpy:1593
translate chinese street_2139c662:

    # N "I {b}will{/b} spend more time with you and Mina, just… let me deal with this mess at work first, okay?"
    N "我{b}会{/b}多陪你和米娜的，只是……先让我处理完工作上的烂摊子，好吗？"

#game/script.rpy:1596
translate chinese street_5f9146f0:

    # N "...."
    N "……"

#game/script.rpy:1600
translate chinese street_850ef128:

    # b "..."
    b "……"

#game/script.rpy:1602
translate chinese street_2e120bea:

    # mc "Son..."
    mc "儿子……"

#game/script.rpy:1604
translate chinese street_d55265b9:

    # N "…Dad."
    N "……爸。"

#game/script.rpy:1606
translate chinese street_850ef128_1:

    # b "..."
    b "……"

#game/script.rpy:1608
translate chinese street_a60da1d1:

    # mc "You've aged."
    mc "你老了。"

#game/script.rpy:1610
translate chinese street_2292ba39_1:

    # N "..."
    N "……"

#game/script.rpy:1612
translate chinese street_6c87f510:

    # N "Says the guy who’s even older than me."
    N "说得好像你比我年轻似的。"

#game/script.rpy:1621
translate chinese street_264afc55:

    # mc "How’ve you been, son?"
    mc "你过得怎么样，儿子？"

#game/script.rpy:1622
translate chinese street_eab0232b:

    # mc "Heard you’ve been living at work lately."
    mc "听说你最近住公司了。"

#game/script.rpy:1624
translate chinese street_88038910:

    # N "Come on, Dad… don’t start."
    N "别这样，爸……别又来了。"

#game/script.rpy:1625
translate chinese street_a2d2e731:

    # N "I know it sucks, alright? But I don’t really have a choice right now…"
    N "我知道这很糟，行吗？但我现在真的没得选……"

#game/script.rpy:1626
translate chinese street_8e106504:

    # N "Anyway, what about you?"
    N "不说这个了，你呢？"

#game/script.rpy:1627
translate chinese street_df2b7963:

    # N "You ever gonna take me up on that? Move in with us?"
    N "你到底要不要考虑一下？搬来和我们住？"

#game/script.rpy:1629
translate chinese street_fca52711:

    # mc "No."
    mc "不。"

#game/script.rpy:1630
translate chinese street_c218977e:

    # mc "Can’t just leave this place."
    mc "不能就这么离开这里。"

#game/script.rpy:1631
translate chinese street_8b7689d0:

    # mc "Too much of Lora in these walls."
    mc "这墙里留着太多洛拉的痕迹。"

#game/script.rpy:1633
