    # N "Dad… watch yourself, alright?"
    N "爸……小心点，好吗？"

#game/script.rpy:5375
translate chinese meets11_01ee1b35:

    # N "Sir… isn’t it a little too dark in here?"
    N "长官……这儿是不是太黑了点？"

#game/script.rpy:5376
translate chinese meets11_63c8b85d:

    # ri "You think so too? Let's fix that... Where is it... Oh, found it."
    ri "你也这么觉得？那来修一下……在哪儿呢……哦，找到了。"

#game/script.rpy:5378
translate chinese meets11_ed5b3e01:

    # ri "Shine like the sun, my dear."
    ri "亮得像太阳吧，亲爱的。"

